@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@connectionToken = replace-with-live-connection-token

### Negotiate a Message connection
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/negotiate?user=alice

### Refresh the live Message connection
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/refresh
X-SignalR-Connection-Token: {{connectionToken}}

### Negotiate a Chat connection
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/negotiate?user=alice

### Refresh the live Chat connection
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/refresh
X-SignalR-Connection-Token: {{connectionToken}}

### Missing connection token returns HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/refresh
